# /etc/openipdata/worker-update.env (root:root 0600): optional settings of the worker updater.
# The file may be missing. A change is read at the next run (every 2 minutes).
# The repository whose release "worker" holds the binaries.
# GITHUB_REPO=shingrus/openipdata.org
# Health check URL: pinged after every run that finds the worker up to date or installs a new
# build, and <URL>/fail when a build fails its check or the worker does not stay up. A secret
# URL: it is never logged.
# HC_PING_WORKER_UPDATE=
# ntfy.sh topic URL (https://ntfy.sh/<long random topic>): one push after each install. The topic
# name is the secret (anyone who knows it can read it): never logged. Empty: no push.
# NTFY_URL=
